From: RT3000 C SSDK notifier fix
Subject: [PATCH] mp: scope PHY notifier mapping by configured MDIO identity

The MP NETDEV_CHANGE notifier is global, while the legacy address-only
mapper can confuse PHYs on distinct MDIO buses and defaults unmapped addresses
to port 0. Resolve only initialized SSDK PHY records using notifier-specific
bus identity and PHY address; dispatch a unique match through the existing
adapter bitmap check. Keep the legacy mapper and its bus-routing state intact.
For default-bus resolution, require explicit equal switch and port MDIO
phandles; missing or unresolved foreign bus identity remains unmatched.

